<title>USA: Winfield, Ill., won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Winfield, Ill., won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth, Inc said it won $1.965 million of Winfield, Ill., general obligation refunding bonds, series 1997A, with a net interest cost of 4.48 percent.</p>
</text>
